# DS-0002 - PostgreSQL runtime USER
#
# database/Dockerfile extends the official PostgreSQL image.
# The official docker-entrypoint.sh initially requires root
# privileges for database-directory initialization and ownership
# management, then drops privileges to the postgres account via
# gosu before starting the PostgreSQL server.
#
# TeamForge independently verifies that:
#   - gosu is rebuilt using a patched Go toolchain;
#   - the gosu binary passes HIGH/CRITICAL vulnerability scans;
#   - PostgreSQL runs as the postgres user after initialization;
#   - the database remains healthy;
#   - schema initialization succeeds.
#
# This exception is restricted to DS-0002 only.
#
DS-0002
